OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1789480719
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby inquiry finds hospital
OL,4,Acould have prevented some deaths, and
OL,5,Arecommends cameras on cots
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmong Thirlwall's recommendations are
OL,8,Flive-streaming cameras on all cots and
OL,9,Fincubators in neonatal units;
OL,10,Frestricting access to insulin; and
OL,11,Fcreating a panel of experts for when
OL,12,Fconcerns are raised
OL,14,FLetby is serving 15 whole-life prison
OL,15,Fterms for murdering seven babies and
OL,16,Fattempting to murder seven more. She
OL,17,Fwas convicted in 2023 and has twice
OL,18,Fbeen denied permission to appeal
OL,19,Fagainst her convictions
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
